{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":17478,\"date\":\"2026-09-05T11:53:24+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-05T09:53:24+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-ultra-iphone-18-pro-anteprima-evento-9-settembre-2026\",\"title\":\"iPhone Ultra e iPhone 18 Pro: anteprima dell’evento Apple del 9 settembre\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple terrà l’evento “Surprise and Shine” mercoledì 9 settembre alle 10:00 (PT). Attesi iPhone Ultra pieghevole, iPhone 18 Pro con nuove fotocamere e aggiornamenti su Watch e AirPods.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/Everything-Apple-Is-Expected-to-Announce-At-Surprise-and-Shine-Thumb-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Everything-Apple-Is-Expected-to-Announce-At-Surprise-and-Shine-Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17263,\"date\":\"2026-08-29T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-29T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-event-9-settembre-sei-prodotti-piu-attesi\",\"title\":\"Apple Event del 9 settembre: i sei prodotti più attesi\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple terrà un evento il 9 settembre alle 10:00 (PT). Ecco i sei prodotti più probabili: iPhone 18 Pro e Pro Max, il primo iPhone pieghevole, Apple Watch Series 12 e Ultra 4, e AirPods 5.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/Apple-Surprise-Shine-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Surprise-Shine\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17203,\"date\":\"2026-08-26T09:06:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-26T07:06:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"nuovi-mac-mini-e-mac-studio-13-dettagli-che-forse-ti-sono-sfuggiti\",\"title\":\"Nuovi Mac mini e Mac Studio: 13 dettagli che forse ti sono sfuggiti\",\"excerpt\":\"Tra aumenti di prezzo, Wi‑Fi 7, genlock via USB‑C, Ethernet più veloce e aggiornamenti su Neural Engine e storage: ecco i dettagli tecnici più interessanti dei nuovi Mac mini e Mac Studio.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/Apple-New-Macs-and-Polishing-Cloth-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-New-Macs-and-Polishing-Cloth\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16949,\"date\":\"2026-08-14T14:55:34+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-14T12:55:34+00:00\",\"slug\":\"cosa-aspettarsi-a-settembre-nuovi-iphone-apple-watch-e-novita-ai\",\"title\":\"Cosa aspettarsi a settembre: nuovi iPhone, Apple Watch e possibili novità AI\",\"excerpt\":\"Settembre potrebbe portare almeno cinque nuovi dispositivi all’evento incentrato su iPhone: iPhone 18 Pro e Pro Max, il primo iPhone pieghevole (“Ultra”), Apple Watch Series 12 e Ultra 4. In parallelo, Apple potrebbe estendere l’integrazione Siri AI anche ad altri prodotti.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/iPhone-18-Pro-Rumored-Colors-768x384.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iPhone-18-Pro-Rumored-Colors\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16235,\"date\":\"2026-07-14T11:55:27+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-14T09:55:27+00:00\",\"slug\":\"come-installare-ios-27-public-beta-sul-tuo-iphone\",\"title\":\"Come installare iOS 27 Public Beta sul tuo iPhone\",\"excerpt\":\"Ecco requisiti, compatibilità e passaggi per preparare il dispositivo e installare la prima public beta di iOS 27, con backup archiviato e indicazioni per il downgrade.\",\"categoryName\":\"Guide\",\"categorySlug\":\"guide\",\"categoryId\":196,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/iOS-27-Install-The-Beta-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27-Install-The-Beta-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16011,\"date\":\"2026-07-06T17:33:36+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-06T15:33:36+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-capacita-batteria-certificazioni-cina\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro: capacità batteria confermate da certificazioni in Cina\",\"excerpt\":\"Nuove pratiche di certificazione in Cina indicano capacità batteria per iPhone 18 Pro e iPhone 18 Pro Max: 4.056/4.288 mAh e 5.391/5.567 mAh (Cina/USA).\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/iphone-17-pro-black-feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-17-pro-black-feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15953,\"date\":\"2026-07-04T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-04T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-16-nuovi-prodotti-seconda-meta-2026\",\"title\":\"Apple, i rumor su 16 nuovi prodotti nella seconda metà del 2026\",\"excerpt\":\"Dopo l’arrivo in beta della nuova Siri più personale, i rumor indicano aggiornamenti per iPhone, Apple Watch, iPad, Mac e la piattaforma smart home: dal possibile iPhone Ultra pieghevole al nuovo Home Hub.\",\"categoryName\":\"Smart Home\",\"categorySlug\":\"smart-home\",\"categoryId\":11,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/Apple-Event-Logo-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Event-Logo\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15923,\"date\":\"2026-07-02T12:35:48+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-02T10:35:48+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macbook-pro-m6-fine-2026-m7-primo-semestre-2027\",\"title\":\"MacBook Pro M6 in arrivo a fine 2026, M7 riprogettato nel primo semestre 2027\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple starebbe preparando un nuovo MacBook Pro da 14 pollici con chip M6 per la fine del 2026 e un modello riprogettato con chip M7 nel primo semestre del 2027, con focus su ottimizzazioni per carichi di lavoro AI.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/macbook-pro-orange-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macbook-pro-orange\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15790,\"date\":\"2026-06-27T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-27T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-primo-iphone-pieghevole-aumenti-prezzo\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro e primo iPhone pieghevole: possibili aumenti di prezzo\",\"excerpt\":\"Rumor da ambienti cinesi: la gamma iPhone 18 Pro e il primo iPhone pieghevole potrebbero arrivare a prezzi più alti del previsto, con il modello pieghevole che potrebbe superare i 2.000 dollari negli USA.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/iphone-17-pro-black-feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-17-pro-black-feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15788,\"date\":\"2026-06-26T17:58:16+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-26T15:58:16+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macbook-oled-top-gamma-apple-m5-pro-m5-max\",\"title\":\"MacBook OLED top di gamma: Apple punta su M5 Pro e M5 Max\",\"excerpt\":\"Il prossimo MacBook di fascia alta con display OLED touchscreen dovrebbe arrivare tra fine 2026 e inizio 2027 con chip M5 Pro e M5 Max, insieme a un nuovo design e una Dynamic Island in stile iPhone.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Apple-M5-Pro-M5-Max-chips-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-M5-Pro-M5-Max-chips\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15636,\"date\":\"2026-06-20T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-20T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-12-motivi-per-aspettare\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro: 12 motivi per aspettare il prossimo salto\",\"excerpt\":\"Dalla nuova strategia di rilascio a batterie più grandi, Dynamic Island più piccola, chip A20 e modem C2: ecco i principali motivi per aspettare iPhone 18 Pro.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Dynamic-Island-iPhone-18-Pro-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Dynamic-Island-iPhone-18-Pro-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15570,\"date\":\"2026-06-16T20:28:52+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-16T18:28:52+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-2028-apple-chip-a22-pro-14-nm\",\"title\":\"iPhone 2028: Apple punta a chip A22 Pro da processo 1,4 nm\",\"excerpt\":\"Per i modelli iPhone di fascia alta previsti nel 2028, Apple starebbe passando da chip a 2 nm a una nuova generazione a 1,4 nm. TSMC produrrebbe la maggior parte dei chip A22 Pro, con valutazioni anche su un coinvolgimento di Intel.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/apple-silicon-1-feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-silicon-1-feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15226,\"date\":\"2026-05-30T13:30:04+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-29T23:24:01+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-lente-diaframma-variabile-piu-cara\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro: lente a diaframma variabile più cara per Apple\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Ming-Chi Kuo, la nuova lente a diaframma variabile dell’iPhone 18 Pro costerà ad Apple circa il 50% in più rispetto ai modelli attuali.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iphone-17-pro-black-feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-17-pro-black-feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15224,\"date\":\"2026-05-30T12:30:52+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-30T10:37:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-colori-dummy-sonny-dickson\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro, i colori in anteprima con i dummy di Sonny Dickson\",\"excerpt\":\"Sonny Dickson ha condiviso immagini di dummy di iPhone 18 Pro nei quattro colori attesi: Light Blue, Black, Silver e Dark Cherry. Prime indicazioni sul look finale.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iphone-18-pro-color-dummies-768x435.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-18-pro-color-dummies\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15132,\"date\":\"2026-05-25T15:45:05+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-25T15:48:07+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macbook-ultra-5-novita-attese\",\"title\":\"MacBook Ultra: 5 novità attese per il nuovo top di gamma Apple\",\"excerpt\":\"Rumor e report indicano un possibile “MacBook Ultra” sopra il Pro: OLED ibrido, touch sul display, design più sottile, Dynamic Island e chip M6 Pro/M6 Max.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/MacBook-Ultra-5-Expected-Features-That-Could-Justify-the-Name-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"MacBook-Ultra-5-Expected-Features-That-Could-Justify-the-Name-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14673,\"date\":\"2026-05-07T17:33:28+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-07T13:37:08+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-display-ltpo-plus-samsung-lg\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro: upgrade display LTPO+ da Samsung e LG\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo The Elec, Apple starebbe finalizzando le approvazioni dei pannelli OLED per iPhone 18 Pro e Pro Max. LTPO+ dovrebbe arrivare da Samsung Display e LG Display.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iPhone-18-Pro-with-a-smaller-centered-Dynamic-Island-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iPhone-18-Pro-with-a-smaller-centered-Dynamic-Island\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14527,\"date\":\"2026-05-03T20:49:26+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-03T18:49:26+00:00\",\"slug\":\"perche-potresti-aspettare-prima-di-comprare-un-macbook-pro\",\"title\":\"Perché potresti aspettare prima di comprare un MacBook Pro\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha aggiornato il MacBook Pro 14” e 16” con M5 Pro e M5 Max, ma i rumor indicano un salto di generazione con display OLED touch, nuovo design e chip a processo 2nm nel 2026-2027.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-MacBook-Pro-M4-hero-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-MacBook-Pro-M4-hero\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14443,\"date\":\"2026-04-25T12:32:52+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-25T10:32:52+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-macbook-ultra-fino-a-sei-nuove-funzioni\",\"title\":\"Apple “MacBook Ultra”: fino a sei nuove funzioni in arrivo\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Bloomberg, Apple starebbe preparando un grande redesign per i MacBook Pro di fascia alta, con possibile branding “MacBook Ultra” e fino a sei nuove funzioni: OLED, touch, Dynamic Island, chip M6 Pro/M6 Max, design più sottile e connettività cellulare.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/MacBook-Pro-Low-Angle-Wide-Lens-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"MacBook-Pro-Low-Angle-Wide-Lens\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14417,\"date\":\"2026-04-24T09:12:34+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-24T07:12:34+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-piano-upgrade-camera-quattro-fasi\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro: Apple valuta un piano di upgrade camera in quattro fasi\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo un leaker cinese, Apple starebbe pianificando quattro aggiornamenti per le fotocamere dei futuri iPhone: il primo riguarderebbe l’iPhone 18 Pro e Pro Max.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/iphone-17-cameras-zoom-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-17-cameras-zoom\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14411,\"date\":\"2026-04-24T09:12:22+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-24T07:12:22+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-quattro-colori-indiscrezioni\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro: nuove indiscrezioni su quattro colori\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo indiscrezioni, Apple starebbe testando quattro colori per iPhone 18 Pro e iPhone 18 Pro Max: Light Blue, Dark Cherry, Dark Gray e Silver. Dark Cherry sarebbe stato confermato da un leaker su Weibo.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/Four-iPhone-18-Pro-Colors-Mock-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Four-iPhone-18-Pro-Colors-Mock-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14324,\"date\":\"2026-04-18T13:32:22+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-18T11:32:22+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-oled-arrivo-ipad-mini-macbook-pro\",\"title\":\"Apple: OLED in arrivo per iPad mini e MacBook Pro\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo ETNews, Apple introdurrà display OLED su iPad mini e MacBook Pro nel corso di quest’anno. Samsung fornirebbe i pannelli.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/ipad-mini-7-feature-red-and-blue-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"ipad-mini-7-feature-red-and-blue\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14314,\"date\":\"2026-04-18T12:54:09+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-18T10:54:09+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-apple-watch-nuove-funzioni-satellitari-amazon\",\"title\":\"iPhone e Apple Watch: nuove funzioni satellitari con Amazon\",\"excerpt\":\"Amazon ha annunciato un accordo con Apple per fornire connettività satellitare alle funzioni attuali e future di iPhone e Apple Watch. Il passaggio a satelliti Amazon Leo è previsto nel 2027.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/Emergency-SOS-via-Satellite-iPhone-YT-768x430.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Emergency-SOS-via-Satellite-iPhone-YT\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14098,\"date\":\"2026-04-02T13:26:17+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-02T11:26:17+00:00\",\"slug\":\"finita-era-productred-apple-cosa-succede-con-iphone-18-pro\",\"title\":\"Finita l’era (PRODUCT)RED di Apple: cosa succede con iPhone 18 Pro?\",\"excerpt\":\"L’ultimo prodotto Apple in (PRODUCT)RED non è più disponibile: l’iPhone 14 Silicone Case in quel colore risulta sold out. Resta da capire se Apple riproporrà (PRODUCT)RED con iPhone 18 Pro.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/PRODUCT-RED-Products-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"PRODUCT-RED-Products\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":6,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13823,\"date\":\"2026-03-11T14:30:50+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-12T20:06:40+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-max-spessore-peso\",\"title\":\"Rivelati spessore e peso dell'iPhone 18 Pro Max\",\"excerpt\":\"L'iPhone 18 Pro Max di Apple sarà leggermente più spesso del suo predecessore, con uno spessore di 8.8mm, rispetto agli 8.75mm dell'iPhone 17 Pro Max.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/iphone-17-pro-dark-blue-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone pro dark blue\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":12,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null}],\"totalPages\":5}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":3600,"tags":["tj-posts"]}